# A project whose interconnect is generated rather than written. It
# brings in one AXI4-Lite subordinate; the test builds a 2x2 crossbar
# with `ip::Crossbar`, wires it to two instances of that subordinate
# with `ip::bus::connect`, and then simulates transactions through it.
#
# There is no `top` and no `source`: the top level is the generator's
# output, which is exactly the point of a generator.
name crossbar_demo
device ice40-hx1k-tq144

depends axi_regs ^1.0.0 path ../../packages/axi_regs
